Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:51:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sources: discard unavailable preference dialogs before
 binding restored views

AndroidX can restore a source preference dialog before its extension screen contains the target preference. Remove the stale dialog before STARTED and preserve dialogs whose preference is present. Shared with anikku-harmony 0116.
---
 .../ui/base/activity/BaseActivity.kt          |  5 ++
 .../details/SourcePreferenceDialogRestore.kt  | 28 +++++++++
 ...ChromeSourcePreferenceDialogRestoreTest.kt | 57 +++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 90 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/ui/browse/extension/details/SourcePreferenceDialogRestore.kt
 create mode 100644 app/src/test/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/ui/browse/extension/details/NavigationChromeSourcePreferenceDialogRestoreTest.kt

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/ui/base/activity/BaseActivity.kt b/app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/ui/base/activity/BaseActivity.kt
